由于你提到的情况涉及到GLM Coding Plan的API Key问题，我们需要根据智谱AI开放平台的接入指南来调整代码。根据接入指南，GLM Coding Plan的API Key和标准API Key是隔离的，且只能用于特定的模型和编码工具。以下是修改后的代码：

```python
import os
import requests

# 确保环境变量ZHIPUAI_CODING_PLAN_API_KEY被设置
assert 'ZHIPUAI_CODING_PLAN_API_KEY' in os.environ

# 使用GLM Coding Plan的API Key
api_key = os.environ['ZHIPUAI_CODING_PLAN_API_KEY']

# 指定模型和请求参数
model = "glm-5.3"
messages = [{"role": "user", "content": "用一句话介绍 Python"}]

# 构建请求
url = "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/coding/paas/v4/chat/completions"
headers = {
    "Authorization": f"Bearer {api_key}",
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
}
data = {
    "model": model,
    "messages": messages
}

# 发送请求并打印结果
response = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=data)
print(response.json())
```

